        <gr str="4905">Maschil </gr>of <gr str="387">Ethan </gr>the <gr str="250">Ezrahite</gr>. I will <gr str="7891">sing </gr>of the <gr str="2617">mercies </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
